    "rich_text_QFw3n3": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_KFeFaV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Orb Bracelets from Shamballa Jewels<br/>Discover the timeless beauty of Orb Bracelets from Shamballa Jewels. Our orb bracelets are designed with a focus on elegance and refinement, making them the perfect accessory for any occasion. Handcrafted in Copenhagen, each bracelet is a unique combination of luxurious materials and artistic design.<br/><br/>Unique Design with Round Beads<br/>Orb Bracelets are characterized by their round beads, available in various sizes and materials, allowing you to choose a bracelet that suits your personal style. The smooth, round shapes create a harmonious balance and a sophisticated expression that adds a touch of elegance to any outfit.<br/><br/>Exclusive Materials<br/>Our orb bracelets are made from the finest materials, including 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. Each material adds its own unique charm and quality, ensuring that your bracelet not only looks stunning but also lasts for many years.<br/><br/>Diamonds and Precious Stones<br/>Each orb bracelet can be adorned with white or black diamonds, as well as other precious stones, adding extra brilliance and personality. The sparkling diamonds give the bracelet an added touch of luxury, while the colorful gemstones create a vibrant contrast that captures attention. Each bracelet thus becomes a unique artwork that reflects your individuality.<br/><br/>Customization: Make It Personal<br/>We offer the option to customize your orb bracelets to reflect your personal style and preferences. Choose from different materials, bead sizes, and gemstones to create a bracelet that is entirely unique to you. Our skilled artisans are dedicated to helping you realize your vision.<br/><br/>Perfect for Everyone<br/>Our orb bracelets are designed for both women and men who appreciate exclusive and timeless jewelry. Whether you're looking for a statement piece for a special occasion or an elegant bracelet for everyday wear, you will find the perfect choice among our collection.<br/><br/>Visit Shamballa Jewels<br/>We invite you to explore our collection of Orb Bracelets in our store in Copenhagen or online. Our team is ready to assist you in finding or designing the ideal bracelet. Experience the unique elegance and quality of Shamballa Jewels’ orb bracelets and add a piece of luxury to your jewelry collection.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
